-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
PLACEHOLDER PUBLIC KEY — REPLACE WITH REAL ED25519 KEY ON FIRST RELEASE.

This file demonstrates the format expected by MCUboot for firmware-image
signature verification. Real public-key bytes will appear here when the
project is signed for the first time. Do not use this placeholder for
any verification — every byte is a placeholder.

Replace by:

  imgtool keygen --key agency-<name>-private.pem --type ed25519
  imgtool getpub --key agency-<name>-private.pem > keys/agency-<name>-public.pem

NEVER commit the private half.
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
